WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:22.240
Crysalis number Alpha 0301,
0303 and 0402.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:26.500
Release from cold sleep,
and pursue the Busoma Azoth!

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:55.190
<i>Please, let Ogata speak again.</i>

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:01.990
<i>And let her have her real smile back
<i>as soon as possible.</i></i>

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:14.090
Good morning, Ogata.
Pleasant morning, isn't it?

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:17.220
The sky's so pretty,
it's enough to make you happy.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.560
The first point
is which word in the sentence

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:27.140
will be conjugated
as the independent word.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.450
Ogata, did you have any questions?

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:45.910
If so, let me know.
I'll ask the teacher for you.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:50.750
You're okay? You're sure?

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:56.210
If you're ever in trouble, just ask me.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:59.550
I'll do anything you need.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:08.810
I'm worried about you, Ogata.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:18.280
Six hours ago,
Marcus Lithos became a Busoma.

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.360
He destroyed the gate and fled.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:24.740
We've confirmed the Busoma is in area G.

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:28.250
I order you to destroy it.

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:30.620
Busoma hunting, huh?

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:34.080
Sounds great.
I can fight as hard as I want to.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.960
Administrator, who is this?
I've never seen him before.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:42.590
Issei Ariga. His Core Alma
is the Demon Sword Nebestigma.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.300
-To him, this job is--
-Horrible.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:48.100
The firmness and smoothness
haven't returned.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:53.230
You didn't do what I told you
before I went into cold sleep, did you?

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.650
Listen. Go eat some vegetables now.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.940
Three servings a day.
Without fail, everyday.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:04.110
Otherwise, you're going to go bald.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:07.410
Marcus Lithos' Core Alma
is the Azoth Sword.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.200
Within it is sealed the devil Beelzebub.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.870
You're up against a devil.
Be careful, Ariga.

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.000
If you don't want to die
on your first job.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:20.710
Fine.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:29.390
<i>So I'm suddenly fighting a Busoma, huh?</i>

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:32.600
<i>And it's a devil? Give me a break.</i>

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.900
What's wrong, new guy? You look down.

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.400
Oh, it's nothing.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:41.650
Did you get scared hearing
that this Busoma is a devil?

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.150
No.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:47.660
Don't worry. My sword
is the Claiomh Solais.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:53.330
A blade of light, held by Nuada,
the god who led the Tuatha Dé Danann.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.920
It's perfect for exterminating devils.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:59.210
By the way, why'd you join the Shoshidai?

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:04.550
If someone who's become a Crysalis
wishes to live their life as a human,

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:06.970
they have no choice
but to join the Shoshidai.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:10.180
But I'm sure you have your reasons, right?

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:12.970
No, that's...

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.600
Issei, she's back.

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.490
I was waiting forever!

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.460
Cut it out, old lady!

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:38.250
I'm sick of seeing you everywhere I go!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:44.300
I can't help it! I'm in love with you!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:47.470
I've never felt like this before!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:54.850
Now, do whatever you want with me...

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:58.140
Issei!

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:04.610
What's wrong?

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:07.030
Come on, just tell us.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.820
<i>I-I can't say it.</i>

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:12.370
<i>If I say I joined the Shoshidai
<i>to protect my chastity,</i></i>

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:13.830
<i>they'll mock me for sure!</i>

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.620
It wasn't anything major.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:29.720
I'm sorry.

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:52.780
Sorry, I didn't realize the teacher
had asked you to do something.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:05.250
H-Hey, hold on.
You don't need to thank me.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:08.510
Come on, please, look up.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.640
Ogata, look outside.

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:23.940
The weather's so nice.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:29.530
It's a waste to spend a day
like this at school, right?

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:33.530
Want to cut class together?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.230
How are you doing? Are you tired?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.070
Sorry. I kind of forced you to come.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:10.860
And we went to a place
where the weather didn't really matter.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.740
I've always wanted to do this.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.620
I haven't done many things
people consider normal.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.710
So I'm having a lot of fun.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.920
Really? You're having fun too?

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:54.320
More exams tomorrow, huh?

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.070
Exams...

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:06.000
I don't like them either.
I want to go outside.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.340
There it is.
Rie's "I want to go outside"-itis.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.630
I want to go outside!
I want to see brother!

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:16.630
You'll get to go outside
with the doctor soon, right?

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:18.970
Just hang in there until then.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:24.060
I want barbecue! I want sushi!
I want them right now!

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:26.850
What's gotten into you, Shoko?

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:29.810
-Brother!
-Barbecue! Sushi! Hamburgers!

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:33.860
Ramen! Pasta! Rice Omelettes!
Pizza and cake would be good too!

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.860
Give me a break, you two.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:39.990
I'm the one who wants a break.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:44.160
Except for one day a month,
we're always stuck in this hospital.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.460
We're not even free to go outside.

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:50.880
We can't help it. Those're the rules.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:52.710
And that's why I put up with it!

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.130
But there are times when I just can't.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:59.640
I'm not a good girl like you, Sayori.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.510
I'm not...

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.470
I miss my brother.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.560
You'd better hold it in, Rie.

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:09.480
Otherwise Sayori the good girl
will get mad at you again.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:18.490
Hey, are you serious, Sayori?

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.990
You're trying to run away?

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:26.200
I want to eat the foods I like
and go for walks outside too.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.210
I'm just trying to hold it in!

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:34.130
But, after what you said,
I can't hold back my feelings anymore.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:39.970
I'm not a good girl.
I'm just like you two.

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:44.720
I'm sorry, Sayori.
I shouldn't have said that.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.650
It won't open.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:54.400
Would it open
if we hit buttons randomly?

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:01.360
I guess not.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.160
Let's look for another exit.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:12.750
There's an art supply store I want
to visit, but where is it?

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:16.380
Hold on, I'll find it on the map.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:35.570
Ogata?

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:46.490
I can feel a strong aura.

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:49.410
It's up ahead.

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.840
Wh-What? What is that?

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:00.760
I'm allowed
to be wherever I want, right?

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.430
You're Shoshidai Crysali, right?

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:07.470
That explains the stink!

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:09.640
Gallon Hammer!

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.980
Is she a Crysalis?

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:19.360
You know what? I hate the Shoshidai!

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:24.200
They keep coming to try and recruit me!
It's so annoying!

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.370
So you'll fight the Shoshidai?

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:30.290
All Crysali must be controlled
by the Shoshidai!

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:38.250
Oh, Issei!

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.670
Ugh! Wh-What are you doing here?

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:46.470
Since I haven't been able to see you,
I've been so lonely!

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:48.430
S-Stay away!

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:51.470
Wait, hold on, Issei!

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.730
You guys are jerks.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:57.730
Don't interfere with my romance!

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:00.820
What is...

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:09.990
I can't get turned on looking
at that face.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.330
I like handsome men.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:15.670
So fight the Shoshidai instead! Poof!

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:25.340
Thanks to that old hag's poison,
my body won't move!

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:26.760
Damn it!

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:40.150
Hey, Administrator, can you hear me?
They're both down!

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:42.320
I can't do this myself!

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:43.860
<i>I'm monitoring the situation.</i>

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:47.780
<i>Return to the Shoshidai immediately.
<i>We'll come up with a new plan.</i></i>

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.120
I must hurry and stop him.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:12.640
The evil aura is everywhere.

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:33.280
No luck here either, huh?

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.790
Hey, this is the fourth place we've tried.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:45.250
Isn't it kind of weird
that all the exits are locked?

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:49.630
True, and I don't see any stairs
to the other floors either.

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:53.100
And I never really thought about it,

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:56.310
but these hallways have no windows.

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.440
Let's try this.

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:14.490
We're going outside, no matter what!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.000
Open!

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:19.910
Yes!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.300
Wh-What is this?

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:49.070
I will have
to overwrite their memories again.

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.620
You were forcing it again, right?

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.670
Forcing yourself to laugh,
to pretend to be okay.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:10.380
Does that happen often?
When you were sketching, before...

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.800
I was thinking...

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:22.730
That you've been fighting
a deep sadness this whole time.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:27.770
I had something similar happen to me.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:35.410
I suffered and fought just like you did.

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:39.240
No, I'm still fighting.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.960
When I recall it,
my heart still starts to ache...

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:49.250
No matter how hard I try,
or how much I want to forget, I can't.

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:23.250
My mother was killed,
and my sister and I were badly hurt.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:27.080
Fortunately, I miraculously survived,

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:31.670
but my sister is still in the hospital,
dealing with the aftereffects.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:36.840
I hate violence. I despise it.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:41.220
But no matter how much you deny violence,
you can't escape it.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.810
The more you try to run from the darkness,

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:48.060
the more it will follow you, forever.

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:50.980
<i>The darkness.</i>

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.070
That's why I seek the light.

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:57.450
I look at the blue sky.
I speak of peace to everyone.

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:01.200
If I don't, it feels
like the darkness will defeat me.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:03.660
But...

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:09.330
But the memory of what happened
that day is so strong that I can't forget.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.590
The darkness is always there,
waiting for me.

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:31.770
It tries to drag me down,
and swallow me up.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.740
<i>No matter how far I ran, it followed me.</i>

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:42.740
I'm scared.

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:45.580
The darkness...

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:50.210
I'm going to fall into it...

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.880
I... I...

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:01.760
No!

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:05.930
O-Ogata?

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.310
...protect you.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.230
I'll protect you.

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:15.900
So...

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:19.150
Ogata, your voice...

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:25.490
So it'll be okay.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.410
Ogata...

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:08.370
That sacrifice is not enough
to satisfy you...

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.210
Shiryu?

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:24.510
You want more blood?

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:26.890
Or perhaps...

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:43.240
And so then... Brother!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:52.750
Rie, how are you doing?

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.960
Oh, I feel great.

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:59.750
The doctor even said that I might be able
to go home for a while.
